Player", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Keep your personal video collection on your own devices and watch it in VR. Choose which headset folders appear in your library, or pair with ViewSeek Library for Windows to stream over an encrypted connection on your home network. Local playback and PC pairing require no ViewSeek account.\n\nMake yourself comfortable. Watch flat and 3D videos on an adjustable screen, or step into immersive 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0 videos. Set your screen size, curve and position, customise controller shortcuts and resume where you left off.\n\nPair with the free Windows companion to organise videos with folders, favourites, ratings and tags. Prepare thumbnails and previews directly from your videos, then browse them on Quest. Matching video parts appear together and play in order from the part you choose. Chapters, ten-second skips, and optional detailed seek previews help you find the right moment.\n\nKeep your videos on the PC for streaming, or copy selected videos to your headset for offline viewing. ViewSeek also works as a standalone headset player and can browse compatible network sources. Bring your own compatible media.", "short_description": "Your personal video collection, on your headset or streamed over your home network. Choose which headset folders appear in your library, or pair with the free Windows companion over an encrypted connection. Watch your own flat, 3D, 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0 videos on Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://viewseek.app/app-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wingsward Works", "support_website_url": "https://viewseek.app/support", "website_url": "https://viewseek.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [